<title>USA: Shiloh Industries to buy Greenfield Die.</title>
<headline>Shiloh Industries to buy Greenfield Die.</headline>
<dateline>MANSFIELD, Ohio 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shiloh Industries Inc said Tuesday it agreed to acquire Greenfield Die &amp; Manufacturing Corp with funds obtained through its credit facilities.</p>
<p>The acquisition of Greenfield Die, a Michigan-based automotive stamping, tool-design and build company, is expected to close on or before the end of October, Shiloh said in a release.</p>
<p>Financial terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Greenfield Die had 1995 sales of about $30 million and employs around 250 people.</p>
</text>
